  "bodyHash": "8958e5f6e78a924f",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>凝灰岩傀儡雕像 ⚜️</h1>\n<p><strong>本模组</strong>&nbsp;为《我的世界》添加了<strong>凝灰岩傀儡雕像与凝灰岩石</strong>，它们分布在<strong>主世界各个生物群系</strong>中，为<strong>原版游戏</strong>增添了更丰富的环境氛围，并以<strong>致敬的形式</strong>让凝灰岩傀儡重返游戏！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0b473d4eeb7b48a57fd28bb74e953e5689f01e87.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡宣传图\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>LuisterCorp &copy; - 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>备注📝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>凝灰岩傀儡雕像</strong>兼容<strong>1.20 至 1.21.10</strong>版本🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>凝灰岩傀儡雕像</strong>为世界生成添加了新的雕像<strong>（结构）</strong>🌐</li>\n<li><strong>凝灰岩傀儡雕像</strong>与任何<strong>世界生成类模组</strong>兼容</li>\n<li><strong>无需</strong>解压下载的文件 🗂️</li>\n<li>建议使用<strong>耳机</strong>以获得<strong>更佳体验</strong>🎧</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>简介 🎼</h2>\n<p>享受更加沉浸式的原版《我的世界》体验，<strong>为凝灰岩傀儡添加新的致敬结构</strong>，为主世界及其所有生物群系带来<strong>独特而多样的特色</strong>🌎。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/902562d27098b1f455b90fd9d47ec6e736ef1e07.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡宣传图\"></p>\n<p>通过此<strong>模组</strong>，探索之旅 🧭 变得更加引人入胜，以雕像形式召回了曾在<strong>投票活动中落败的凝灰岩傀儡</strong>。</p>\n<h2>生成方式🌐</h2>\n<p><strong>每个生物群系</strong>都有独特的凝灰岩生成样式，具体因群系而异。以下是各生物群系及其对应的<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>示例：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩石</p>\n<p>🪨&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩石</strong>，若想使用<strong>指令</strong>定位，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_rock</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡树树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0d30f8445e074d0dd3875058f760c0dd6c80cf51.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩石\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡树树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:#is_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 红色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/78d531297579e4fc69f640a0ee20f322999ba971.png\" alt=\"红色包裹物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，红色雕像变体属于<strong>常见稀有度</strong>，若想使用<strong>指令</strong>定位，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_red</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡树树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d950859550cfbe9cd6b1441aac72db623abcd7c9.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（红色）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡树树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:dark_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 粉色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b8ed0ed31a42bc2b9d390873152c0c75b6764a61.png\" alt=\"粉色包裹物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，粉色雕像变体属于<strong>常见稀有度</strong>，若想使用<strong>指令</strong>定位，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_pink</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d83635524a41412b5f7b37ac1464e4d3102e79d.png\" alt=\"樱花树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/01232d94f583b2dad68a3cf9c9be4db87854eea8.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（粉色）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d83635524a41412b5f7b37ac1464e4d3102e79d.png\" alt=\"樱花树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:cherry_grove\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 黑色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c2a41e4f8ffd4fdeb0c91f17e326fece16484894.png\" alt=\"黑色包裹物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，黑色雕像变体属于<strong>常见稀有度</strong>，若想使用<strong>指令</strong>定位，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_black</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b33943d5396e6b6eb4e92a1a56778ab6bf87a2af.png\" alt=\"金合欢树苗\">