://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c4145fcd1686b59699a5376a07c83b282de6a8f.png\" alt=\"黄绿色包裹物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，黄绿色雕像变体属于<strong>常见稀有度</strong>，若想使用<strong>指令</strong>定位，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_lime</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡树树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/51698357a71e0449eb71dd43ce35f29a8eeaafff.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（黄绿色）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡树树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:plains\"\n\n\"minecraft:forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 蓝色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4a2e98ba76179772464a6cf062d416dd6fdbccca.png\" alt=\"蓝色包裹物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，蓝色雕像变体属于<strong>常见稀有度</strong>，若想使用<strong>指令</strong>定位，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_blue</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e8add1cd34b1c0271f2005f430cb9ce23456c09d.png\" alt=\"矢车菊\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fabd5ba4da11886561f4f143d8502ac067219488.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡（蓝色）\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e8add1cd34b1c0271f2005f430cb9ce23456c09d.png\" alt=\"矢车菊\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:jagged_peaks\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 青色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eaa459267163f3e73b969d883e3c0cdb2d5d4f5e.png\" alt=\"青色包裹物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，青色雕像变体属于<strong>常见稀有度</strong>，若想使用<strong>指令</strong>定位，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_cyan</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/dat