"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 洋红色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/34fd93ce4920972a886e902ffe456c2ad36219dc.png\" alt=\"洋红色包裹物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，洋红色雕像变体具有&nbsp;<strong>普通稀有度</strong>，如果你想通过&nbsp;<strong>指令</strong>查找它，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_magenta</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b73ca081d395eb3bfebd49fdf94ef87cc5e8ceb6.png\" alt=\"丁香物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb0854bca37fb097fa1035c9748d17f59617ee4c.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡 洋红色\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b73ca081d395eb3bfebd49fdf94ef87cc5e8ceb6.png\" alt=\"丁香物品\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:flower_forest\"\n\n\"minecraft:meadow\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 灰色</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d815b05d1fea15f9b57d613ac247b429cbe6ee1e.png\" alt=\"灰色包裹物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，灰色雕像变体具有&nbsp;<strong>稀有稀有度</strong>，如果你想通过&nbsp;<strong>指令</strong>查找它，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_gray</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8100ab22a7e7bdc543e2d3b239725ff5762d6814.png\" alt=\"棕色蘑菇\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7a2f56d9729ed03d2c0172f92070629715124d9.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡 灰色\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db7cd1020ed8f6ab949346acf099e8d8827d9303.png\" alt=\"红色蘑菇\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:mushroom_fields\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>凝灰岩傀儡 - 三重雕像</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae0bf0d042b3174771fef77c4a81196f5f236415.png\" alt=\"包裹物品\">&nbsp;<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>，三重雕像变体具有&nbsp;<strong>罕见稀有度</strong>，由三种颜色组合而成，如果你想通过&nbsp;<strong>指令</strong>查找它，请使用：<code>/locate structure luistercorp:tuff_golem_triple</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/005307a32ef556a08001a7e866db2bdb636a9f1d.png\" alt=\"杜鹃花树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/17545e4264a94ff73c4c40f97cd70a595ff35df1.jpeg\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡 三重\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/005307a32ef556a08001a7e866db2bdb636a9f1d.png\" alt=\"杜鹃花树苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:old_growth_pine_taiga\"\n\n\"minecraft:old_growth_spruce_taiga\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>新成就 🏆（新增进度）</h2>\n<p>在主世界中找到所有<strong>凝灰岩傀儡</strong>的变体将解锁一套针对<strong>找到所有颜色</strong>的新成就，而找到<strong>全部 17 种凝灰岩傀儡变体</strong>将解锁一个隐藏的进度，名为<strong>“雕像收藏”</strong>，显示如下：</p>\n<p>◾&nbsp;<strong>图片&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d27c3d64d2c9cf14b4494937edfc09f03068279e.png\" alt=\"地图物品\">:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d00684089a3ef1c428eb86f489c8f43765be540c.png\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡成就\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
